+# thermal-v2v: DMD / self-forcing few-step stage with a BIDIRECTIONAL teacher (CausVid / Self-Forcing recipe).
+# Student (generator): causal AR model from the teacher-forcing SFT (v1 EMA snapshot), 2 interleaved frames per block,
+#   LoRA r128 trained FROM SCRATCH (B=0, no LongLive-Plug init: the Plug LoRA, trained on RGB T2V, pulled outputs toward
+#   grayscale-photo appearance, e.g. dark windows where the teacher has hot/bright ones), 4 UniPC steps, self-forcing rollouts.
+# Real score + critic: the phase-1 bidirectional ICL teacher (wan_models/ default weights) run as ONE block over the
+#   whole interleaved clip (full attention). The real score has no chunk seams, so DMD pulls the student's rollouts
+#   toward seam-free videos. Unconditional branch = RGB zeroed (the ICL teacher's null condition); scale 1.0 = CFG 2.
